# AMB Portfolio - Environment Variables Example
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values if needed.
# Firebase configuration is stored in firebase-applet-config.json.
# No environment variables are required for standard local development.
#
# Optional:
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_browser_safe_key
# VITE_PERF_ENDPOINT=https://your-observability-endpoint.example.com/ingest
# VITE_DISABLE_SW=true
